# Example Polybar Configuration

```ini
[module/workspaces]
type = internal/xworkspaces
icon-0 = 1;󰈹
icon-1 = 2;󰆍
icon-2 = 3;󰍡
icon-3 = 4;󰡨
icon-4 = 5;󰋩
icon-5 = 6;󰉋
icon-6 = 7;󰊗
icon-7 = 8;󰒓
icon-8 = 9;󱂬
icon-default = 󰣇
```

You can mix and match icons from both sets by ensuring you have both fonts installed and properly configured in your polybar config.
